-mkt-deal-action="closed"><?php esc_html_e('Close record', 'marketplace'); ?></button><?php endif; ?><?php if (in_array((string) $deal['status'], ['accepted','arranging','completed','cancelled'], true)): ?><button class="mkt-button mkt-button-danger" data-mkt-dispute><?php esc_html_e('Open dispute', 'marketplace'); ?></button><?php endif; ?><?php else: ?><p><?php esc_html_e('This record is open in purpose-limited reviewer mode. Decisions are made through the moderation workspace.', 'marketplace'); ?></p><?php endif; ?></div></section></div><aside class="mkt-panel mkt-deal-aside"><h2><?php esc_html_e('Important limitations', 'marketplace'); ?></h2><ul><li><?php esc_html_e('The platform does not hold funds or guarantee payment.', 'marketplace'); ?></li><li><?php esc_html_e('Delivery is arranged directly unless a future approved adapter is shown.', 'marketplace'); ?></li><li><?php esc_html_e('Keep evidence relevant to the transaction and do not upload patient data.', 'marketplace'); ?></li></ul></aside></div>
